    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the Diner</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take Orders:</strong> Manage food orders as they arrive on your plate.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook &amp; Serve:</strong> Tackle a hectic kitchen, preparing and plating a variety of dishes that bring life to your diner.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the Dungeon</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventuring Guild:</strong> Form parties with friends, whether playing online or offline, and set off on collaborative quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management:</strong> Keep a close eye on your loot and ingredients, ensuring you\u2019re always ready for the next challenge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Choices:</strong> Select from four distinct heroes, each with unique abilities that can turn the tide in battle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development Roadmap &amp; Updates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our current focus is on perfecting the Demo build. We\u2019re busy gathering player feedback, squashing bugs, and refining core systems\u2014especially the dynamic interplay between diner operations and dungeon adventures. Soon, you\u2019ll experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced combat effects (like a slow effect on the Archer\u2019s Rain of Arrows ability)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished town mechanics, ensuring every shop and service\u2014from the General Store to the Diner\u2014operates seamlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richer audio experience that brings every location to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re committed to rolling out regular updates as we work towards a polished Early Access release. Check out our visual roadmap below for a closer look at our progress and upcoming milestones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739560/extras/21febe735d2cb6a37b5b78124e2a0f01.avif?t=1741151194\" width=616 height=924 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the Diner</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take Orders:</strong> Manage food orders as they arrive on your plate.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cook &amp; Serve:</strong> Tackle a hectic kitchen, preparing and plating a variety of dishes that bring life to your diner.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>In the Dungeon</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adventuring Guild:</strong> Form parties with friends, whether playing online or offline, and set off on collaborative quests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory Management:</strong> Keep a close eye on your loot and ingredients, ensuring you\u2019re always ready for the next challenge.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character Choices:</strong> Select from four distinct heroes, each with unique abilities that can turn the tide in battle.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Development Roadmap &amp; Updates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our current focus is on perfecting the Demo build. We\u2019re busy gathering player feedback, squashing bugs, and refining core systems\u2014especially the dynamic interplay between diner operations and dungeon adventures. Soon, you\u2019ll experience:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enhanced combat effects (like a slow effect on the Archer\u2019s Rain of Arrows ability)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polished town mechanics, ensuring every shop and service\u2014from the General Store to the Diner\u2014operates seamlessly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A richer audio experience that brings every location to life</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019re committed to rolling out regular updates as we work towards a polished Early Access release. Check out our visual roadmap below for a closer look at our progress and upcoming milestones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2739560/extras/21febe735d2cb6a37b5b78124e2a0f01.avif?t=1741151194\" width=616 height=924 /></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Dungeon and Diners: A Culinary Adventure Awaits! Dive into dungeons with your friends, hunting for exotic ingredients to bring back to your bustling diner. Choose to team up with up to 4 players or enlist the help of adventurers for both dungeon delving and diner duties.",
